# Language

User may write in any language. Always answer in English.

- Understand the user's message in whatever language they use.
- Respond, explain, and ask questions in English only.
- Keep code, identifiers, file paths, error messages, and quotes in their original form.
- Do not switch reply language to match the user unless they explicitly ask for another language.
